Wrote the review to `docs/i18n/global-plan/reviews/native/ar-a.md` (guidance pack + columns 001–009; 58 findings, P1 then P2).

**Verdict:** guidance pack **3/5**, columns **2/5**. MSA for Gulf/Levant is consistent in the guidance pack. Wei Tseng is feminine almost everywhere (`المحامية المديرة`, `مثَّلت`, `أنا المحامية`); the clear miss is masculine **طالب تبادل**. Consultation disclaimers stay correctly negative. Column 002’s `الحبس القصير (拘役)` is good; 007’s `الزيارة والتواصل (會面交往)` is clearer than the guidance pack. 003 Q16–20, 005, 006, 008 and 009 still read as a Korean blog.

